			"Message": "chore(Project): Update Cocoon and Wind submodules with IPC contracts\n\nAdvance `Cocoon` to bf9d9ffa to introduce `Types.ts` under `Source/Services/Mountain/gRPC`. This formalizes the contract between the extension host and native backend by defining Option DTOs (e.g., `ShowTextDocumentOptions`, `TextEdit`) and the `IMountainGRPCClientService` interface. These changes enable strong typing for native operations without importing the full Effect-TS runtime, improving modularity.\n\nAdvance `Wind` to a25a3c5b to add `MountainCommands.ts` and `Converters.ts`. These modules centralize file-system IPC method strings (e.g., `file:stat`, `file:readdir`) and implement pure conversion logic between VS Code URI shapes and Mountain's raw JSON responses. This isolates protocol mapping from core services, facilitating unit testing and ensuring synchronization with native handlers.\n\nThese updates align the UI service layer and extension host with the native backend's evolving IPC architecture, ensuring type safety and separation of concerns across the editor stack.",
			"SHA": "77ab17dd24a00312f6547195315c304358afcf65"
